    "permission": "Seymour Duncan allows free sharing; commercial use needs prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Logical HOT/RETURN terminals replace the PDF’s black/white leads; bare leads ground to casings. The PDF bridge ground ends at the master-tone casing; no bridge terminal exists. The 0.05 uF cap maps to 47 nF. Logical pot lugs and a linear scale omit physical orientation and audio taper. Two volumes exceed the master-volume limit, so the estimate is unavailable."
